# Paths excluded from the marketplace package.
#
# Everything here is development-only. Shipping it broke the Store's static
# analysis: that environment installs runtime requirements only, so any file
# referencing a require-dev package resolves to nothing and the analyser aborts
# with internal errors before it produces a single real finding.
#
# deploy.php needs deployer/deployer, and all 51 files under tests/ extend
# PHPUnit\Framework\TestCase - both require-dev.
#
# rsync exclude syntax: a leading slash anchors the pattern to the package root,
# so `/tests` cannot match a directory of the same name nested inside src/.
#
# Used by .github/workflows/bundle.yml (release packaging) and
# .github/workflows/extension-verifier.yml (which validates the built package).

/.git
/.github
/.gitignore
/.idea
/.packageignore
/.phpunit.result.cache

# Deployer recipe - deployer/deployer is require-dev
/deploy.php

# Test suite - phpunit/phpunit is require-dev
/tests
/phpunit.xml

/phpcs.xml

# phpstan.neon, its baseline and stubs/ deliberately DO ship.
#
# The Store's analysis picks up the extension's own phpstan.neon, and
# stubs/shopware-core-stubs.php conditionally declares the classes that exist
# in only some supported versions - AsyncPaymentTransactionStruct and
# AsynchronousPaymentHandlerInterface are gone in 6.7, but the check resolves
# shopware/core to the highest version our constraint allows. Without the stubs
# the run aborts on an internal error before reporting anything, which is the
# same failure this file exists to prevent.
#
# Verified with `shopware-cli extension validate --full --only phpstan`:
#   stubs + phpstan.neon excluded -> 1 problem, an internal error, run aborts
#   stubs + phpstan.neon shipped  -> 96 errors, 0 internal errors, run completes
# phpstan-baseline.neon must ship too, because phpstan.neon includes it.

# Root build tooling. Shopware reads src/Resources/app/*/package.json for
# plugin assets, never this one; it only drives the legacy admin webpack build
# whose output is committed under src/Resources/public.
/package.json
/package-lock.json
/webpack.legacy.config.js

/CONTRIBUTING.md
